# - coauthor-guard allowlist, one co-author identity per line.
# - The commit-msg and pre-push hooks block trailers not listed here.
# - An empty allowlist blocks every co-author trailer, which is the default.
# - A line is a name plus an email in angle brackets, or an email alone.
# - Matching uses the email when one is present, lowercased. Else the whole value.
# - Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# - Default policy: this repo allows no co-author trailers.
# - The history was polluted by unwelcome Co-Authored-By Claude trailers.
# - To allow an identity, add one line below, like:
# -
# -   Your Name <you@example.com>
